  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened law enforcement and Labour inspection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will strengthen the country&#x2019;s capacity for law enforcement and labour inspection and enhance the UAE&#x2019;s overall regulatory framework, ensuring more effective governance of labour standards and promoting safer, healthier working conditions. By empowering MoHRE to implement modern, proactive labour inspections, the ILO will drive systemic improvements in compliance, reduce workplace risks, and foster a culture of safety and accountability. Ultimately, this will support the UAE&#x2019;s long-term goals of sustaining decent work environments and aligning with international labour standards, thereby contributing to national economic growth and social stability.</narrative>
  </description>
